      "boundary": "Printed page 5 describes approximate cell averages and numerical fluxes approximating physical edge fluxes reasonably well, but supplies no numerical tolerance, norm, order or step error formula. The proposed interpretation uses independent numerical old data, time-averaged physical fluxes and explicit old/face-error bounds implying a next-step bound. That quantitative convention is not uniquely selected by the source and its pending question remains material."
