      "boundary": "Printed page 5 assigns the ordered neighboring cell averages to Riemann states, obtains information from the solution and computes fluxes and updates; the nearby continuation permits approximate solvers. The source does not prescribe a full returned field or an all-real trace domain. The information-only alternative removes that avoidable representation restriction. The independent-reference finite-step comparison still requires the separately pending interpretation of the qualitative accuracy relationship; no universal accuracy guarantee follows merely from solve/extract functions."
    },
